       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DUAL-WAVE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DUAL-WAVE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SYNTHETIC-LAMBDA-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STEP-TOPOGRAPHY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GLARE-GATING-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DWDHI-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DWDHI-SEAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DUAL-WAVE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PDW-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PDW-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LAMBDA-AND-TOPO.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-GLARE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PDW-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LAMBDA-AND-TOPO.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SYNTHETIC-LAMBDA-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STEP-TOPOGRAPHY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-GLARE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GLARE-GATING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DWDHI-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PDW-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SYNTHETIC-LAMBDA-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STEP-TOPOGRAPHY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GLARE-GATING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DWDHI-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DWDHI-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PDW-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PDW-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PDW-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PDW-CODE.
